# Shopify Store Configuration
SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-admin-api-access-token

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to your Shopify Admin Panel
# 2. Navigate to Settings > Apps and sales channels > Develop apps
# 3. Create a custom app and install it
# 4. Configure Admin API access scopes (read permissions for all resources)
# 5. Copy the Admin API access token to SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN
# 6. Set SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN to your store's domain
